From: tyn-patches <tyn-patches@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 18:13:36 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] log: free the formatted line after writing it

ImpLogImpl took the line buffer from ImpStackAlloc, which is malloc outside
MSVC, and never released it, so every log line leaked. With VM tracing on
this grew the heap by several MB a minute until Android killed the game.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

diff --git a/src/log.cpp b/src/log.cpp
index 048daf08feb1f218c814fda14b706914e10b6950..aa07ed1a988fd09196612cd4770d185582391a5e 100644
--- a/src/log.cpp
+++ b/src/log.cpp
@@ -71,6 +71,7 @@ void ImpLogImpl(LogLevel level, LogChannel channel, fmt::string_view format,
   *tailFormat.out = '\0';
 
   ConsoleWrite(level, line);
+  ImpStackFree(line);
 }
 
 void LogToFile(void* userdata, [[maybe_unused]] int category,
